{"id":"steam-1358780","steam":1358780,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"SKAZ: Shadow of the Tsar","summary":"An isometric action-RPG where memory is your weapon and four fractured realms shape your fate. Wake without a name — and survive. As long as you’re remembered, you live.","about":"SKAZ: Shadow of the Tsar\n\nAS LONG AS YOU’RE REMEMBERED — YOU LIVE.\n\nAn isometric action-RPG where memory is your weapon, fate is currency, and a shattered Slavic world breathes with forgotten gods.\n\nYou awaken without a name.\r\nWithout a past.\r\nIn a world torn into four realms — Yav, Nav, Prav, and Vid — where every memory can reshape you… or destroy you.\n\nThe world recognizes you.\r\nThen instantly forgets.\n\nTo survive, you must remember who you were…\r\nor choose who you will become.\n\nWHY THIS GAME IS DIFFERENT\n\nNo classes. No limits. You rebuild your identity.\n\nEvery memory fragment you recover:\n\n• \nunlocks new abilities and combat styles,\n• \nreshapes your personality and morality,\n• \nalters NPC relationships,\n• \nopens hidden paths and outcomes,\n• \nchanges how the world reacts to you.\n\nYou don’t follow a story.\r\nYou reconstruct your soul.\n\nCombat driven by will, ritual, and forgotten power\n\nFight:\n\n• \nNav-born monsters,\n• \nshadows of ancient gods,\n• \ncursed volkhs,\n• \ncreatures erased even from folklore.\n\nUse Slavic rites, protective symbols, curses, and abilities tied to what you choose to remember.\n\n \n\nFour realms. Four laws. One broken world.\n\nExplore:\n\n• \nYav — the mortal world, collapsing under its own weight\n• \nNav — land of the dead, where whispers drown screams\n• \nPrav — forsaken domain of gods\n• \nVid — reality of reflections and stolen memories\n\nThese aren’t just locations.\r\nThey are four versions of reality, woven into a living system.\n\nSlavic noir carved in shadow and myth\n\nFog-drenched forests, ancient idols, drowned villages, ghost-lit marshes.\r\nThis is not a fairy tale.\r\nThis is SKAZ — a world trying to forget you.\n\nRECLAIM YOUR NAME.\n\nRECLAIM YOUR FATE.\r\nAS LONG AS YOU’RE REMEMBERED — YOU LIVE.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358780/d5d82dbf57de0a73e2f0c7b1cd234e48951bd631/library_capsule.jpg?t=1764701923","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358780/0e16b857463256cf35e5e27e232aff58337bc249/header.jpg?t=1764701923","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358780/8f28dce6740aa6197af63a5a3da92a8d367249bc/library_hero.jpg?t=1764701923","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358780/0e16b857463256cf35e5e27e232aff58337bc249/header.jpg?t=1764701923","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358780/d776d99b3b2ce8a2dff28cf0661f5c638861fe2a/page_bg_v6.jpg?t=1764701923","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358780/834cbdf6085a2e6d0e305728f371f2eed1cb3c67/ss_834cbdf6085a2e6d0e305728f371f2eed1cb3c67.600x338.jpg?t=1764701923","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358780/834cbdf6085a2e6d0e305728f371f2eed1cb3c67/ss_834cbdf6085a2e6d0e305728f371f2eed1cb3c67.jpg?t=1764701923"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358780/5ec02e01b3261b43651d1d3a4018eb1479059903/ss_5ec02e01b3261b43651d1d3a4018eb1479059903.600x338.jpg?t=1764701923","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358780/5ec02e01b3261b43651d1d3a4018eb1479059903/ss_5ec02e01b3261b43651d1d3a4018eb1479059903.jpg?t=1764701923"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358780/0b6d2999fdb56f2796b160651d4f6aec5470b523/ss_0b6d2999fdb56f2796b160651d4f6aec5470b523.600x338.jpg?t=1764701923","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358780/0b6d2999fdb56f2796b160651d4f6aec5470b523/